        schema:description     "Korean taekwondo leader. An early member of the karate division of the Chosŏn Yŏn-Mu Kwan, he reopened it with Yoon Kwe-byung in 1951 as the Jidokwan and became its head in 1967. As chairman of the Korea Taekwondo Association's technical committee he wrote its 1971 manual, the first with only the new taekwondo forms. Later secretary general and vice president of the WTF, he was a central figure in making taekwondo a full-contact sport."@en;
