<https://martial.is/entity/01M5JGQAC7XV79MRCH8733JRZ4>
        rdf:type                     martialis:Place;
        schema:alternateName         "Bartitsu Academy of Arms and Physical Culture"@en;
        schema:alternateName         "Bartitsu School of Arms and Physical Culture"@en;
        schema:description           "E. W. Barton-Wright's club and academy for Bartitsu and physical therapy in a basement hall at 67b Shaftesbury Avenue, Soho. Its instructors included the jujutsuka Yukio Tani, Sadakazu Uyenishi and Seizo Yamamoto, the Swiss wrestler Armand Cherpillod and the stick-fighting master Pierre Vigny; Alfred Hutton's historical fencing group also met there. It closed in 1902–1903."@en;
