<https://martial.is/entity/01KZ27S9JES5Y85CE58PH0NG6M>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:alternateName           "Hitohira Saito"@en;
        schema:alternateName           "斎藤 仁平"@ja;
        schema:birthDate               "1957-02-12";
        schema:birthPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KZ27S9JES5Y85CE58PH0NG6M/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:description             "Instrutor japonês de aikido e mestre fundador do Iwama Shin-Shin Aiki Shuren-kai (ISSASK). Filho de Morihiro Saito, iniciou o Aikido com Morihei Ueshiba aos sete anos, tornou-se instrutor oficial do dojo de Iwama em 1986 e, após a morte do pai, separou-se do Aikikai em 2003 para fundar o ISSASK. Conhecido desde 2009 como Hitohira (仁平) Saito."@pt;
        schema:description             "Japanese aikido instructor and founding headmaster of Iwama Shin-Shin Aiki Shuren-kai (ISSASK). Son of Morihiro Saito, he began aikido under Morihei Ueshiba at age seven, became official instructor at the Iwama dojo in 1986, and after his father's death separated from the Aikikai in 2003 to found ISSASK. Known since 2009 as Hitohira (仁平) Saito."@en;
