        schema:description      "Kobayashi Shorin-ryu is the school of Okinawan karate developed by Chibana\nChoshin (1885-1969) based on what he learned from Anko Itosu. Chibana was\nthe first to establish a Japanese ryu name for an Okinawan karate style,\nnaming Itosu's karate Shorin-ryu in 1929. The school descends from the\nShuri-te tradition and preserves the kata of Itosu's teaching.\n"@en;
