<https://martial.is/entity/01KZ0Y4CF4F7BSWN3P3T4QZC5G>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:birthDate               "1883-10";
        schema:birthPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KZ0Y4CF4F7BSWN3P3T4QZC5G/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:deathDate               "1966";
        schema:deathPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KZ0Y4CF4F7BSWN3P3T4QZC5G/deathEvent/deathPlace>;
        schema:description             "Japanese Daitō-ryū aikijūjutsu master and representative instructor (kyōju dairi) under founder Takeda Sōkaku. He introduced Morihei Ueshiba, founder of aikidō, to Takeda in 1915. After World War II he taught Daitō-ryū in Tokyo, training students including Masutatsu Oyama, Richard Kim, and Choi Yong-sul.\n"@en;
        schema:description             "大東流合気柔術の師範で、開祖・武田惣角のもとで教授代理を務めた。1915年に合気道創始者の植芝盛平を武田に紹介した。戦後は東京で大東流を指導し、大山倍達、リチャード・キム、崔龍述らを教えた。\n"@ja;
