        schema:description     "Japanese aikido teacher, a 3rd dan at the time, who came to Portugal around 1975/76 and taught aikido at the Escola de Budo in Lisbon (Largo de Sapadores) and in several dojos of Lisbon and Almada, launching the Shiseikai association in the country. He returned to Japan in 1978 and was replaced by Toshio Kawakami."@en;
