        martialis:informationType     infotype:secondary;
        martialis:quotation           "In Quebec for example, Harold Tokai, an ex-B.C. Judoka, started the Montreal YMCA Judo Club in 1946, and later, in 1952, with Kametaro Akiyama and Fred Okimura, established the Seidokwan Academy of Judo. Sponsored by the Japanese community, it was the first permanent dojo in Montreal.";
