        schema:description              "French Wikipedia article on Charles Lecour (1808–1894), who joined savate with English boxing to form French boxing: savate learned from Michel \"Pisseux\", boxing lessons from the English professional Adams in Paris (as Lecour told Joseph Charlemont), his salle in the passage des Panoramas opened in 1832 with his brother Hubert, his student Rambaud \"la résistance\", and Charlemont as his student."@en;
