        schema:archivedAt               <https://web.archive.org/web/20260518130533/https://webhiden.jp/topics/20240716/>;
        schema:datePublished            "2024";
        schema:description              "Web Hiden topic article (July 16, 2024) announcing a new bimonthly series on the Dai Nippon Teikoku\nKendo Kata, transmitted from Nakayama Zendo - the son of Nakayama Hakudo - to Ogawa Takeshi, the 10th\nheadmaster of the Yushinkan dojo and Shindo Munen Ryu. Confirms that Zendo was Hakudo's son and that\nhe was the designated successor who inherited Hakudo's martial knowledge in its totality, including\nthe kata compiled by Hakudo himself. The article references the August 2024 issue of Monthly Hiden\nas the source of the full series.\n"@en;
