<https://martial.is/entity/01M0TVMGJVP7A46XX9P8WFSBTW>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "Cannon Fist"@en;
        schema:description      "Pao Chui (Cannon Fist) is a northern Chinese Long Fist (Changquan) martial art known for its explosive, powerful techniques. The name refers to the characteristic 'cannon-like' force of its strikes. Pao Chui emphasizes rapid-fire combinations, grounded stances, and sudden bursts of power from a stable base. It is one of the three major Changquan families alongside Chaquan and Huaquan. The style's core curriculum includes multiple numbered forms. Pao Chui was one of the foundational influences on modern competition wushu Changquan and remains practiced as a standalone art."@en;
        schema:description      "炮捶是中国北方长拳的一种，以爆发力强、动作刚猛著称。名称源于其'炮'般的击打力度。炮捶 强调快速连贯的组合、稳固的步法和从稳定基础发出的突然爆发力。炮捶是查拳、华拳并列的长拳 三大门类之一。其核心套路包括多路编号套路。炮捶是现代竞技武术长拳的重要基础之一，至今仍 作为独立拳种习练。"@zh;
        schema:keywords         "paochui";
        schema:keywords         "changquan";
        schema:keywords         "northern";
        schema:keywords         "long-fist";
        schema:keywords         "chinese-martial-arts";
        schema:name             "Pàochuí"@zh-Latn;
        schema:name             "炮捶"@zh;
        schema:name             "Pao Chui"@en;
