        schema:datePublished            "2015-11-10";
        schema:description              "Essay by literary critic Yamauchi Yukihiro (author of Mishima Yukio no Nikutai, Kawade Shobo Shinsha, 2014 - the standard study of Mishima's physical culture) marking the 45th anniversary of his death. Details the September 1955 start of bodybuilding with a home coach, the September 1956 entry into boxing under Nichidai club head coach Kojima Tomoo (with fellow pupil Ishibashi Hirotsugu, later All-Japan bantamweight champion), the sparring sessions filmed by Ishihara Shintaro, and Mishima's own words on finding in kendo \"my homeland... the ideal harmony of body and spirit\"."@en;
