        martialis:informationType  infotype:secondary;
        martialis:quotation        "Katsuya Miyahira (宮平 勝哉, Miyahira Katsuya; 1918–2010) was an Okinawan martial artist who was the grand master of the Shorin-ryu Shido-kan style of Okinawan Karate [...] Miyahira created the Shido-kan branch of Kobayashi Shorin-ryu after the death of his teacher, Chōshin Chibana.";
