        martialis:confidenceLevel      conflevel:confirmed;
        martialis:confidenceRationale  "Iaijutsu is the drawing-focused subset of kenjutsu's broad sword umbrella - originally a part of kenjutsu before becoming a dedicated discipline - so iaijutsu practitioners count as kenjutsu practitioners; per musoshindenryu.fi 'originally, iaijutsu was a part of kenjutsu'." .

