<https://martial.is/entity/01KZ3QDN0YC8DBGT0X2NPH1CS6>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:alternateName           "Barry Alan Knight"@en;
        schema:birthDate               "1945";
        schema:birthPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KZ3QDN0YC8DBGT0X2NPH1CS6/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:description             "Professor australiano de aikido (6º dan, Iwama Ryu) e Chief Instructor do Aikido Takemusu (Vic). Licenciado em física, engenharia e gestão de risco, iniciou o Aikido em Melbourne em 1970, praticou no Hombu Dojo do Aikikai em 1976 e foi uchi deshi de Morihiro Saito em Iwama de 1978 a 1980. Estabeleceu o Rensei Dojo em Melbourne no início dos anos 1980 e foi o primeiro professor de Tristão da Cunha."@pt;
        schema:description             "Australian aikido teacher (6th dan, Iwama Ryu) and Chief Instructor of Aikido Takemusu (Vic). A graduate in physics, engineering and risk management, he began aikido in Melbourne in 1970, practiced at the Aikikai Hombu Dojo in 1976, and was uchi-deshi under Morihiro Saito at Iwama from 1978 to 1980. He established the Rensei Dojo in Melbourne in the early 1980s and was the first teacher of Tristão da Cunha."@en;
        schema:keywords                "aikido";
        schema:keywords                "iwama-ryu";
        schema:keywords                "australia";
