<https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:alternateName           "市毛高治"@ja;
        schema:alternateName           "Ichige Takaharu"@en;
        schema:birthDate               "1862-12-16";
        schema:birthPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:deathDate               "1929-04-09";
        schema:deathPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H/deathEvent/deathPlace>;
        schema:description             "Mito-domain swordsman of the Hokushin Ittō-ryū, born into the Ichige family. Entered the Mito Tobukan at 12 (1874) under Kozawa Torakichi - kirigami at 14, mokuroku at 18 - and trained at Sakakibara Kenkichi's dojo in Tokyo for a year (1883-1884) before a country pilgrimage. In 1881, at 19, adopted into the Naitō family. Joined the Keishichō in 1888 and later opened the Yōshinkan dojo in Tokyo and served as gekiken shihan of the Tōkyō Senmon Gakkō (Waseda). One of five kendo teachers named for the Butokuden in Kyoto in 1899, where he served until his death and was chief kendo professor of the Bujutsu Kyōin Yoseijo, later the Budo Senmon Gakko, 'Waza Monna, Ki Takaharu' alongside Monna Tadashi. Chief commissioner of the 1911 Dai-Nippon Teikoku Kenjutsu Kata; opposed kendo's sportification and the 1929 Tenran shiai, died before it was held."@en;
        schema:description             "北辰一刀流の剣道家。水戸藩士・市毛家の六男として生まれる。12歳で小澤寅吉の東武館に入門（14歳で切紙、 18歳で目録）、1881年内藤儀左衛門の養嗣子となる。1883年上京し榊原鍵吉の道場で一年修行。1888年警視庁に入庁。 1899年京都の武徳殿に五教授の一人として奉職、武術教員養成所（のち武道専門学校）の剣道主任教授を務め、 「西の内藤、東の高野」と言われた。1911年大日本帝国剣道形制定の主査委員。競技化を嫌い切り返し・掛かり稽古 を徹底指導、昭和天覧試合に反対し、開催直前に脳出血で急死。"@ja;
        schema:keywords                "hokushin-ritto-ryu";
        schema:keywords                "kenjutsu";
        schema:keywords                "jikishinkage";
        schema:keywords                "kendo";
        schema:keywords                "koryu";
        schema:keywords                "mito";
        schema:keywords                "tobukan";
        schema:keywords                "busen";
        schema:keywords                "butokukai";
        schema:keywords                "keishicho";
        schema:name                    "内藤 高治"@ja;
        schema:name                    "Naitō Takaharu"@ja-Latn;
        schema:nationality             <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H/nationality/0>;
        schema:sameAs                  <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q11394577>;
        schema:sameAs                  <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Naitō_Takaharu>;
        martialis:birthEvent           <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H/birthEvent>;
        martialis:deathEvent           <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD6H/deathEvent>;
