<https://martial.is/entity/01KYYYTTW3BX37M2ESX9PKY0FY>
        rdf:type                martialis:Place;
        schema:alternateName    "極真会館総本部"@ja;
        schema:alternateName    "Oyama Dojo Tokyo"@en;
        schema:alternateName    "Kyokushinkaikan Sohonbu"@en;
        schema:description      "The original Tokyo dojo of Mas Oyama, opened in 1953 and the birthplace of Kyokushin karate. Foreign students such as Roger Lesourd trained directly under Oyama here. It moved into the new Kyokushinkaikan building in Nishi-Ikebukuro in 1964 and is today the Sohonbu (headquarters dojo) of the International Karate Organization Kyokushinkaikan."@en;
        schema:description      "1953年に開かれた大山倍達の最初の道場であり、極真カラテ発祥の地。ロジェ・ルスールら海外の弟子が大山のもとで直接稽古し、後に国際空手道連盟極真会館の中核となった。\n"@ja;
