<https://martial.is/entity/01M3267J3YGHCXQZ4GZPY3AP6A>
        rdf:type               martialis:Person;
        schema:description     "幕末に土佐藩の藩校・致道館で無雙神傳英信流（下村派）を教授した師範。高木流体術拳法の師範も兼ねた。 慶応4年（1868年）、細川義昌に無雙神傳英信流の免許皆伝を授けた。"@ja;
        schema:description     "Tosa-domain shihan of the Muso Shinden Eishin-ryu (Shimomura-ha line) at the domain school Chidokan in the late Edo period; he taught the school until the Meiji Restoration and was also a shihan of Takagi-ryu jujutsu kenpo (JA wiki). He granted the school's menkyo kaiden to Hosokawa Yoshimasa in 1868, on the eve of the Boshin war."@en;
        schema:keywords        "eishin-ryu";
        schema:keywords        "koryu";
        schema:keywords        "tosa";
        schema:keywords        "iaijutsu";
        schema:name            "下村 茂市"@ja;
