<https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9E>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "為勢自得天眞流柔術"@ja;
        schema:alternateName    "Ise Jitoku Tenshin-ryū"@ja-Latn;
        schema:description      "Jigo Tenshin Ryu (also known as Isei Jitoku Tenshinryu) is one of the martial arts handed down from the Fukuoka Domain. It was founded as a comprehensive martial art system, but the jujutsu component is the one that has been handed down to the present. Many ancient techniques remain, including joint techniques, restraining techniques, and Kappo. In 2005, it was designated as an intangible cultural property of Fukuoka City.\n"@en;
        schema:description      "O Jigo Tenshin Ryu (também conhecido como Isei Jitoku Tenshinryu) é uma das artes marciais tradicionais do Domínio de Fukuoka, Japão.Na época de sua fundação, era uma arte marcial completa, mas foi o jujutsu que foi transmitido até aos nossos dias. Preserva muitas técnicas antigas como as centradas na manipulação de articulações, imobilização,e kappo. Em 2005, foi designado como propriedade cultural imaterial da cidade de Fukuoka.\n"@pt;
        schema:description      "自剛天真流（じごうてんしんりゅう）は、福岡藩伝来の武術の一つ。別 名、為勢自得天真流。創流時は全てのものを武器として使用する綜合武 術であったが、現在では主に柔術が相伝されている。古式の技法が数多 く残されており、逆手を中心とした関節技、居取、拳法、逮捕術、活法 など多彩な技を今に伝えている。また2005年に福岡市の無形文化財に指 定された。\n"@ja;
        schema:keywords         "koryu";
        schema:name             "Jigō Tenshin Ryū"@ja-Latn;
        schema:name             "自剛天真流"@ja;
        schema:video            <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9E/videos/0>;
        martialis:foundedEvent  <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9E/foundedEvent>;
        martialis:hasEvidence   <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9E/hasEvidence/0>;
        martialis:hasEvidence   <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9E/hasEvidence/1>;
        martialis:hasStyleRelationAssertion  <https://martial.is/entity/01M3YH7N5GT5JFJRTDB9PH80CJ>;
        martialis:styleType     <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/style-classification/traditional>;
        martialis:variantOf     <https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9G> .

