        schema:alternateName   "Escrima"@en;
        schema:description     "Ang Arnis, na kilala rin bilang Eskrima o Kali, ay ang pambansang sining pandigma ng Pilipinas. Binibigyang-diin nito ang pakikipaglaban gamit ang mga patpat, kutsilyo, at iba pang sandata, pati na rin ang mga teknik na walang sandata."@fil;
        schema:description     "Arnis, also known as Eskrima or Kali, is the national martial art of the Philippines. It emphasizes weapon-based fighting with sticks, knives, bladed weapons, and improvised weapons, as well as open-hand techniques. The World Eskrima Kali Arnis Federation (WEKAF) governs international competition. Dan Inosanto is a major proponent and teacher of FMA through the Inosanto Academy."@en;
