        schema:description             "Portuguese aikido practitioner (2nd dan, Iwama Ryu) and student of Tristão da Cunha at the Aiki-Shuren Dojo de Portugal, who began aikido in January 1983. He is the author of the \"Aikido em Portugal\" interview series and an important collector of the history of aikido and other martial arts in Portugal."@en;
