        schema:description      "Classical school of naginata for armoured combat, tracing to Toda Seigen, a retainer of Asakura Yoshikage who inherited the main line of Chujo-ryu (Toda-ryu); carried by the Sakuya family and, from the 14th head, by women headmasters. Named Toda-ha Buko-ryu by the 13th head, Sakuya Ryosuke Takeyuki. Heads (its own page) end with the 19th Nitta Suzuyo, Nakamura Yoichi, and the 21st, Kenjo Hisayo."@en;
