<https://martial.is/entity/01M016NFYMMS7TPPKEWK72GRT2>
        rdf:type                        martialis:Source;
        schema:archivedAt               <https://web.archive.org/web/20250531110637/https://onsamsterdam.nl/artikelen/judoka-wim-ruska-ik-kan-geen-baas-boven-mij-voelen>;
        schema:datePublished            "2017";
        schema:description              "Magazine profile of Wim Ruska in Ons Amsterdam (July/August 2017) by Peter de Brock. Details his Amsterdam upbringing, early judo at club Yu-Ai, and his move to train at Jon Bluming's club Tung Jen; calls Bluming \"Ruska's judomeester\" and describes Ruska beating him with six ippons after three months. Also covers the 1964 Tokyo selection dispute, the Munich double gold, and his later years."@en;
