<https://martial.is/entity/01M0BCX1Y5AW75KC9GPT5CPFCQ>
        rdf:type               martialis:Person;
        schema:description     "関口新心流の柔術家。紀州藩で柔術師範を務め、半田弥太郎は1860年より彼のもとで関口新心流を学んだ。\n"@ja;
        schema:description     "Japanese jujutsu master of the Sekiguchi Shinshin-ryu school. Served as jujutsu instructor in the Kishu domain,\nwhere Handa Yataro studied Sekiguchi Shinshin-ryu under him from 1860. Wolf (2016) describes Handa's later\nDaito-ryu jujutsu as an obscure development of Sekiguchi-ryu jujutsu.\n"@en;
