<https://martial.is/entity/01M5KWGPRK69RHM30T18CYDJ7H>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "Lecour style"@en;
        schema:alternateName    "Genre Lecour"@en;
        schema:description      "The gymnastic form of French boxing founded by Charles Lecour in Paris about 1832, joining savate kicks with English boxing punches after his lessons with the English boxer Adams. Charles and his brother Hubert developed it at their salle in the passage des Panoramas; it became common in the 1860s. Lecour never published it. Joseph Charlemont later drew on it for his academic method."@en;
        schema:description      "Forme gymnique de la boxe française fondée par Charles Lecour à Paris vers 1832, qui joint les coups de pied de la savate aux coups de poing de la boxe anglaise apprise de l'Anglais Adams. Charles et son frère Hubert la développent dans leur salle du passage des Panoramas ; elle se répand dans les années 1860. Lecour ne la publie jamais."@fr;
        schema:keywords         "savate";
        schema:keywords         "france";
        schema:name             "Lecour method"@en;
        schema:name             "Méthode Lecour"@fr;
        martialis:foundedEvent  <https://martial.is/entity/01M5KWGPRK69RHM30T18CYDJ7H/foundedEvent>;
