<https://martial.is/entity/01KYHTJXCXHYSC519CB367XXZK>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "TKD"@en;
        schema:alternateName    "Tae Kwon Do"@en;
        schema:description      "Korean martial art and combat sport centred on kicks and punches. Developed in the 1940s and 1950s from the nine original kwans of Tang Soo Do, by Korean practitioners with a background in karate and Chinese martial arts. An Olympic sport since 2000, under World Taekwondo (WT) and the International Taekwon-Do Federation (ITF)."@en;
        schema:description      "태권도는 한국의 무술이자 격투 스포츠로, 주로 발차기 기술과 펀치를 사용한다.\n1940~1950년대에 걸쳐 개발되었으며, 2000년부터 올림픽 정식 종목이 되었다.\n"@ko;
        schema:image            <https://martial.is/entity/01KYHTJXCXHYSC519CB367XXZK/photos/0>;
