        schema:description      "Comprehensive classical school centred on the sword (iaijutsu and kenjutsu), with yawara, spear and other weapons, founded by Tatsumi Sankyo in the Eisho era (1504-1520) and the official style of the Sakura domain from the 1670s. Headmasters (the ryu's own list): 1 Tatsumi Sankyo, 2 Tatsumi Iwami-no-kami, 3 Tatsumi Kazumanosuke, 4 Mikami Hannojo, 5 Matsui Kotofuru, 6 Kuwajima Tazaemon, 7 Oishi Sensuke, 8 Yamaguchi Shichirozaemon, 9 Takekawa Kyubei, 10 Kasuya Dankuro, 11 Henmi Ryuho, 12 Henmi Sohachi, 13 Hanzawa Kihei, 14 Henmi Shinkuro, 15 Hanzawa Gon'emon (the same man as the 13th), 16 Henmi Sohachi, 17 Henmi Chuzo, 18 Hanzawa Naritsune, 19 Kato Hisashi, 20 Kato Sadao, 21 Kato Takashi, 22 Kato Hiroshi."@en;
