        rdf:type               martialis:Person;
        schema:birthDate       "1833";
        schema:deathDate       "1862";
        schema:description     "千葉周作の二男。父の死後、江戸の玄武館を継いだ。1862年（文久2年）没。門弟の下江秀太郎が明治期に活躍した。"@ja;
        schema:description     "Second son of Chiba Shusaku; succeeded his father at the Genbukan dojo in Edo (Bennett). After his death in 1862 the dojo passed to his younger brother Michisaburō. His student Shimoe Hidetaro (from 1858) carried the Genbukan line into the Meiji era (JA wiki, Chiba Shusaku; Shimoe Hidetaro)."@en;
