<https://martial.is/entity/01M0BCX1XZQJC48W8V3Z71K07B>
        rdf:type               martialis:Style;
        schema:description     "柔術の古流流派。大東流柔術の文献には、半田弥太郎が1860年より紀州藩にて関口氏胤からこの流儀を学んだと記録される。\nWolf (2016) は半田の大東流柔術を関口流柔術の一変種として記述している。\n"@ja;
        schema:description     "A koryu school of jujutsu. Records preserved in the Daito-ryu jujutsu literature name Sekiguchi Ujitane as\nHanda Yataro's teacher in the style from 1860, while Handa was serving in the Kishu domain; Handa's later\nDaito-ryu jujutsu is described by Wolf (2016) as an obscure development of Sekiguchi-ryu jujutsu.\n"@en;
        schema:keywords        "koryu";
        schema:keywords        "jujutsu";
        schema:keywords        "japan";
        schema:name            "関口新心流"@ja;
        schema:name            "Sekiguchi Shinshin-ryū"@ja-Latn;
        schema:sameAs          <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q4388218>;
        martialis:hasEvidence  <https://martial.is/entity/01M0BCX1XZQJC48W8V3Z71K07B/hasEvidence/0>;
