        schema:datePublished            "2024";
        schema:description              "Budo Japan interview (HIDEN February 2024) with Higaonna Morio, head of IOGKF. States everything in Goju-ryu started with Higaonna Kanryo Sensei (1853-1915), who went to the Chinese province of Fujian at the age of 15 to avenge his father's enemies and to study under the Chinese martial arts master Lulukou; his desire for revenge disappeared as he became a master, and he returned to the Ryukyu to become a master of Naha-te."@en;
