<https://martial.is/entity/01M3YH7N5GZ4J3KQNSF5AMF47J/hasConfidence>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Confidence;
        prov:wasAttributedTo           <https://martial.is/agent/FSM>;
        martialis:assessedBy           <https://martial.is/agent/FSM>;
        martialis:confidenceLevel      conflevel:probable;
        martialis:confidenceRationale  "The France Judo obituary of Abe lists Pierre Roussel among the reputed French professors and judoka around whom Abe reinforced the rayonnement of Kodokan judo, and Brousse names him among the rare champions practising the Kodokan method at the time; neither source states the exact nature of the relationship beyond his training at the club." .

