<https://martial.is/entity/01M0BCX1Y3RBG7X8VRJDME7PZZ>
        rdf:type               martialis:Person;
        schema:description     "天神真楊流の柔術家。半田弥太郎は彼のもとで天神真楊流を学び、後に大東流柔術の技を考案した。1876年に半田が大阪へ移り\n継いだ道場は山名新十郎のもので、新九郎の関係者とされる。\n"@ja;
        schema:description     "Japanese jujutsu master of the Tenjin Shin'yo-ryu school. Handa Yataro studied Tenjin Shin'yo-ryu under him,\nand Handa later devised the Daito-ryu jujutsu curriculum largely from that school. A related figure, Yamana\nShinjuro (山名新十郎) of Osaka, whose dojo Handa succeeded to on settling in the city in 1876, is regarded as a\nrelation of Shinkuro.\n"@en;
