        schema:description             "Miyagawa Taichiro was born on Kaei first. He served the Kuroda clan as a retainer. He was an accomplished martial artist, having learned Itto-ryu kenjutsu and Jigo Tenshin Ryu jujutsu, which he taught at the Genyosha-linked dojo that would be the origin of the Meidokan. He participated in the Hagi Rebellion against the Meiji government.\n"@en;
