        schema:description             "Professor australiano de aikido (8º dan Aikikai, shihan) e artista, presidente da Aiki Kai Australia e membro do Conselho Sénior da Federação Internacional de Aikido. Iniciou o Aikido em 1964 e foi aluno vitalício de Seiichi Sugano desde 1965 até à morte de Sugano em 2010. Foi promovido a 8º dan no Kagami Biraki de janeiro de 2025."@pt;
        schema:description             "Australian aikido teacher (8th dan Aikikai, shihan) and artist, president of Aiki Kai Australia and member of the International Aikido Federation Senior Council. He began aikido in 1964 and was a lifelong student of Seiichi Sugano from 1965 until Sugano's death in 2010. He was awarded the 8th dan at the Kagami Biraki in January 2025."@en;
