<https://martial.is/entity/01KJJAWN29MA64W22606R3WD9H>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "Samozashchita bez oruzhiya"@ru-Latn;
        schema:alternateName    "самозащита без оружия"@ru;
        schema:description      "Martial art and combat sport of Soviet origin, developed for Red Army hand-to-hand combat in the early 1920s. The name (Russian: самбо) abbreviates samozashchita bez oruzhiya, 'self-defence without weapons'. It draws on judo, jiu-jitsu and several wrestling styles, and UWW recognises it as a style of amateur wrestling. Vasili Oshchepkov is counted among its founders."@en;
