        schema:description              "Kengokan (Shorinjiryu Kenkokan) Karate Dojo Canberra page on Kaiso Kori Hisataka (1907-1988), founder of Shorinjiryu Kenkokan Karatedo. Covers his birth in Shuri, the Kudaka family arts (Kudaka-ryu Okinawa-te and Shishiryu bojutsu), his training under weapons master Sanda Kanagusuku, Chotoku Kyan as his main teacher (Taiwan tour 1929-30), Kodokan judo 4th dan under Sanpo Toku, the Manchurian years, and the founding of the first Kenkokan dojo in Hamada, Kyushu after the war."@en;
