<https://martial.is/entity/01M19K1VNM2S928FZ7CKCBAHC8>
        rdf:type               martialis:Person;
        schema:alternateName   "鍾馗の半助"@ja;
        schema:alternateName   "Shōki no Hansuke"@ja-Latn;
        schema:birthDate       "1845";
        schema:birthPlace      <https://martial.is/entity/01M19K1VNM2S928FZ7CKCBAHC8/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:deathDate       "1897";
        schema:description     "中村半助（1845年 - 1897年）は、日本の柔術家。筑後国久留米藩出身で、良移心当流を修めた。1883年より東京警視庁の 柔術世話係（師範役）を務め、「鍾馗の半助」の異名をとった。1886年の警視庁柔術試合における講道館・横山作次郎との 引き分けの一戦で知られ、富田常雄の小説『姿三四郎』の村井半助のモデルとなった。"@ja;
        schema:description     "Nakamura Hansuke (1845–1897) was a Japanese jūjutsuka of the Ryōi Shintō-ryū, born in Kurume. Appointed to the Tokyo Metropolitan Police jūjutsu staff in 1883, he became one of the strongest police jūjutsu instructors of the era, nicknamed \"Shōki no Hansuke\" for his enormous strength and iron-hard neck training. Fought the famous ~55-minute draw against the Kodokan's Yokoyama Sakujirō at the 1886 police jūjutsu matches; model for Murai Hansuke in Tomita Tsuneo's novel Sanshirō Sugata."@en;
        schema:name            "中村 半助"@ja;
        schema:name            "Nakamura Hansuke"@ja-Latn;
        schema:nationality     <https://martial.is/entity/01M19K1VNM2S928FZ7CKCBAHC8/nationality/0>;
        schema:sameAs          <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q66828357>;
        martialis:birthEvent   <https://martial.is/entity/01M19K1VNM2S928FZ7CKCBAHC8/birthEvent>;
        martialis:deathEvent   <https://martial.is/entity/01M19K1VNM2S928FZ7CKCBAHC8/deathEvent>;
