<https://martial.is/entity/01KZGHWBBT4X64RAEV23YM5AGA>
        rdf:type                        martialis:Source;
        schema:archivedAt               <https://web.archive.org/web/20250815104944/https://medium.com/motobu-ryu-blog/nakama-ch%C5%8Dz%C5%8Ds-goj%C5%ABshiho-4f56af8f63d6>;
        schema:datePublished            "2023";
        schema:description              "Motobu Naoki's Motobu-ryu Blog article (September 2, 2023) on Nakama Chozo's Gojushiho kata. States Nakama was a senior disciple of Chibana Choshin; when Motobu Choki briefly returned to Okinawa for the 1936 Roundtable of Karate Masters, Nakama learned kumite from him; after the war Nakama had a close relationship with Uehara Seikichi, exchanging techniques. Notes Nakama had no dojo of his own, teaching at a local community center and his home, and that per Nakamoto Mamoru (Bunbukan Dojo) Nakama learned Gojushiho from Hanashiro Chomo."@en;
        schema:inLanguage               "en";
        schema:keywords                 "article";
        schema:keywords                 "shorin-ryu";
        schema:keywords                 "motobu-ryu";
        schema:keywords                 "karate";
        schema:name                     "Nakama Chōzō's Gojūshiho - Motobu-ryu Blog";
