        schema:description      "Shorinji-ryu (Shorinjiryu Kenkokan Karate) is a style of karate founded by\nKori Hisataka in Kumamoto in 1945, emphasizing spiritual development through\nkarate training. Hisataka studied karate under Chotoku Kyan, kobudo under\nSanda Kanagusuku, judo at the Kodokan and Chinese martial arts in Manchuria;\nthe style he created combines these influences.\n"@en;
