<https://martial.is/entity/01M377JZDN8THA45FQJXJKZT8P>
        rdf:type                  martialis:Organization;
        schema:description        "First Dai Nippon Butokukai committee to standardise kenjutsu kata for schools, chaired by Watanabe Noboru. Seven kenjutsu experts holding the title of hanshi were appointed on 7 May 1906, joined in July by seven younger experts holding kyōshi. It produced the three-form Dai-Nippon Butokukai Seitei Kenjutsu Kata, presented to the Butokukai president on 13 August 1906 and poorly received. The ten-form Dai-Nippon Teikoku Kenjutsu Kata of 1911-12 superseded it."@en;
