<https://martial.is/entity/01KZY2QD0F1CQN6A0Z5Q4470T6>
        rdf:type                        martialis:Source;
        schema:alternateName            "Jean de Herdt, 88 ans, une légende du judo";
        schema:archivedAt               <https://web.archive.org/web/20221003233007/https://www.lyonne.fr/saint-fargeau-89170/sports/jean-de-herdt-88-ans-une-legende-du-judo_1117812/>;
        schema:datePublished            "2012";
        schema:description              "Regional press article published 14 March 2012 on Jean de Herdt at age 88, presenting him as the first pupil of Mikinosuke Kawaishi, the man who implanted judo in Europe. Recounts the 1935 meeting between de Herdt (then 14, below the 17-year minimum age) and Kawaishi, insisted upon by de Herdt's father, a champion of Greco-Roman wrestling; and that three years later de Herdt was among the first to obtain the black belt, at age 17. The article is cited by Cichorei Kano's E-Judo forum post on de Herdt."@en;
        schema:inLanguage               "fr";
        schema:keywords                 "press";
        schema:keywords                 "judo";
        schema:name                     "Jean de Herdt, 88 ans, une légende du judo - Lyonne.fr";
