        martialis:quotation        "From 1962 on, after his first visit in Iwama, he decides to follow the teaching of O'Sensei and of his assistant, Morihiro Saito Sensei [...] In 1968, he becomes Morihiro Saito's Uchideshi and is rapidly adopted by the Master's family [...] Tomita Sensei practiced for about 7 years at the Iwama Dojo. Those years were for him formativeyears dedicated to education and to discovering the way of Budo.";
        martialis:supports         true .

