        martialis:confidenceLevel      conflevel:probable;
        martialis:confidenceRationale  "Stanley Pranin calls Inoue Ueshiba's number one student, and Inoue (interview part 2) says he practised with his uncle. JA Wikipedia has Inoue teaching the new art before Ueshiba joined him at Omoto, and Inoue's students called him a co-founder. Pranin draws on Inoue's own interviews, and was a well-known and respected author on Aikido and martial arts." .

