<https://martial.is/entity/01M6BJ6H8F9AJ21DEBPS0XD3XA>
        rdf:type                martialis:Style;
        schema:alternateName    "将監鞍馬流"@ja;
        schema:alternateName    "Shōkan Kurama-ryū"@ja-Latn;
        schema:description      "Classical school of swordsmanship founded by Ōno Shōkan in the Tensho era (1573-1593), restored in the late Edo and Meiji periods by the Shibata family (15th head Shibata Mamoru, a Metropolitan Police instructor), who still lead it. Known for uchiotoshi; part of its technique entered the police Keishi-ryu."@en;
