        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:description             "American martial artist, researcher, and author of The Kanō Chronicles. Director of the US Embassy Judo Club, Tokyo. Board Member of the Tokyo Judo Federation. Advisor to the International Martial Arts Federation (IMAF). Certified judo instructor, All Japan Judo Federation. Former US Army political-military affairs officer and US State Department Foreign Service officer. Direct student of Sato Shizuya in Nihon Jujutsu for over 20 years. Also practices Shintō Musō ryū jōdō, Hapkidō, and Takeuchi ryū jūjutsu."@en;
