<https://martial.is/entity/01KZ6D9E8Q0V5Y8Y88RMM4W7G6>
        rdf:type                       martialis:Person;
        schema:birthDate               "1954-10-19";
        schema:birthPlace              <https://martial.is/entity/01KZ6D9E8Q0V5Y8Y88RMM4W7G6/birthEvent/birthPlace>;
        schema:description             "French-Portuguese aikido teacher, student of Georges Stobbaerts from 1964 to 1998 (judo briefly from 1964, aikido from 1968) and technical director of the Associação Portuguesa de Aikido e Disciplinas Associadas (APADA). He received 5th dan from Stobbaerts. He studied aikido with Gérard Obélianne in Casablanca during 1971-73 and kendo and iaido under Claude Durix. Since 2000 he has studied under Mitsugi Saotome Shihan. He was the principal mentor of the FPA's history of aikido in Portugal and held leadership roles in the APADA, the CDAM and the FPADA."@en;
        schema:description             "Professor de Aikido luso-francês, aluno de Georges Stobbaerts de 1964 a 1998 (Judo brevemente desde 1964, Aikido desde 1968) e diretor técnico da Associação Portuguesa de Aikido e Disciplinas Associadas (APADA). Recebeu o 5º dan das mãos de Stobbaerts. Estudou Aikido com Gérard Obélianne em Casablanca entre 1971 e 1973 e Kendo e Iaido com Claude Durix. Desde 2000 estuda com o Shihan Mitsugi Saotome. Foi o principal mentor da história do Aikido em Portugal publicada pela FPA e ocupou cargos de liderança na APADA, na CDAM e na FPADA."@pt;
        schema:keywords                "portugal";
        schema:keywords                "france";
        schema:keywords                "apada";
        schema:keywords                "aikido";
        schema:keywords                "kendo";
        schema:keywords                "judo";
