        schema:description             "Japanese jujutsuka of Tenjin Shinyo-ryu. Student of Genjuro Jinbo. Received menkyo (1879) and menkyo kaiden (1890) in Tenjin Shinyo-ryu. Appointed as Keishicho martial arts instructor in 1886. Operated the Seibukan dojo in Kyobashi, Tokyo. Described by Gunji Koizumi as \"quite an impressive figure with a long grey beard.\" Teacher of Gunji Koizumi, founder of the Budokwai."@en;
        schema:name                    "Tago Nobushige"@ja-Latn;
        schema:name                    "田子信重"@ja;
